{"des":"白雪下的经商之道-阿娜洛洁互动","script":"s_5_11_2","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0.4,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara043_1","x":570,"y":-119,"bright":1,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara043_1","transTime":300,"x":570,"y":-119,"bright":1,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]拿回来了！运气很不错，大部分的货都安然无恙。缪夏，你那边情况如何？[l][cm]","charaName":"阿娜洛洁"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara043_1","transTime":300,"x":570,"y":-119,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]感谢你们的帮助，我的货物都顺利带回来了。这次我吸取了索利德山运花的教训，特别选择了适合在雪原保存的货物。[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1c","layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara043_1","transTime":300,"x":570,"y":-119,"bright":1,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]哦？我有些好奇你都进了些什么货呢，能说说具体进了哪些商品吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"阿娜洛洁"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara043_1","transTime":300,"x":570,"y":-119,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]就是清凉的果饮！这种饮料方便保存，很适合雪原里的人携带。我老爸十年前就卖过一次，赚了好多钱呢！[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]探险家们应该也会喜欢这种搭配——每次啃完难嚼的牛肉干后喝一口清凉的饮品，在艰苦的野外环境中简直是种享受。[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara043_1","transTime":300,"x":570,"y":-119,"bright":1,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这个……你的想法是好的，但是很遗憾地告诉你，你这车果汁肯定卖不好。[l][cm]","charaName":"阿娜洛洁"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara043_1","transTime":300,"x":570,"y":-119,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]啊？卖不好？为……为什么这么说……[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_9"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a","layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara043_1","transTime":300,"x":570,"y":-119,"bright":1,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]首先口味就不对，你让雪原上生活的人喝清凉饮料，人家不嫌弃你就不错了。至于你老爸为什么会成功，因为十年前这里是火山啊！[l][cm]","charaName":"阿娜洛洁"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_10"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1c","layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]再说探险家会不会喜欢，在野外生存本来就是要吃苦的。除非果饮有很高的营养价值，否则探险家们不可能大批量采购。[l][cm]","charaName":"阿娜洛洁"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_11"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara043_1","transTime":300,"x":570,"y":-119,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]什么……这……这我确实没想到……[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara043_1","transTime":300,"x":570,"y":-119,"bright":1,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]唉……可惜了，要是能带些冰块送到索利德山去，说不定就能大卖了，实在可惜……[l][cm]","charaName":"阿娜洛洁"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_13"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara043_1","transTime":300,"x":570,"y":-119,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]怎么会……我……我又要失败了吗……[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_14"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a","layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara043_1","transTime":300,"x":570,"y":-119,"bright":1,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]做生意还是要慎重考虑需求啊。不过一次失败也算不了什么，下次继续努力就好。[l][cm]","charaName":"阿娜洛洁"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_15"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara043_1","transTime":300,"x":570,"y":-119,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我……我已经失败很多次了。身为商人之女，从小我就仰慕我那位商人老爸，所以一直在向他学习。[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_16"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]可这么多年经商下来一直很失败，每次深思熟虑后却总是做出错误的选择。这么多年过去，大家都觉得我是个笨蛋，只把我当作\"老爸的女儿\"……[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_17"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我……我想证明自己……不想一直躲在老爸的羽翼下。[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_18"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1b","layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1b","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara043_1","transTime":300,"x":570,"y":-119,"bright":1,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]唉……可怜的孩子啊，你还年轻。有些大生意你是把握不住的，你交给姐，看姐是怎么做的。[l][cm]","charaName":"阿娜洛洁"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_19"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1b","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara043_1","transTime":300,"x":570,"y":-119,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]明明一副小孩子模样，偏要摆出老前辈的架势……[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_20"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]阿娜洛洁前辈，你还有办法吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_21"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1b","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara043_1","transTime":300,"x":570,"y":-119,"bright":1,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]那当然有了，我们先回大书院吧。只要你愿意相信我，我就给你示范一下，商人要如何实现绝地重生！[l][cm]","charaName":"阿娜洛洁"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_22"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1b","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara043_1","transTime":300,"x":570,"y":-119,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我……我相信你！不知为何我能感觉到你绝非凡人！我们这就回大书院！[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生缪夏"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_23"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]行吧，我们也跟着回去吧……商品都到货了，我也想看看这家伙要怎么绝处逢生。[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_24"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1b","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara043_1","transTime":300,"x":570,"y":-119,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[hide]","charaName":""}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}]}